  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Interpretative shell-form reconstruction. Lower valve silhouette and 210 mm scale from PRI 80129. Low flat circular upper valve is genus-level anatomical reconstruction supported by University of Padua, NOT asserted preserved on PRI 80129. No soft anatomy or exact scan claim. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"working_dimensions_mm\": {\"height_z\": 210, \"width_x\": 115, \"depth_y\": 105}, \"basis\": \"PRI publishes length 21 cm. Width and depth are working proportional estimates from oblique thumbnail, not measured specimen dimensions; modest asymmetry acceptable. Total height includes interpretive thin lid.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Interpretative shell-form reconstruction. Lower valve silhouette and 210 mm scale from PRI 80129. Low flat circular upper valve is genus-level anatomical reconstruction supported by University of Padua, NOT asserted preserved on PRI 80129. No soft anatomy or exact scan claim. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"working_dimensions_mm\": {\"height_z\": 210, \"width_x\": 115, \"depth_y\": 105}, \"basis\": \"PRI publishes length 21 cm. Width and depth are working proportional estimates from oblique thumbnail, not measured specimen dimensions; modest asymmetry acceptable. Total height includes interpretive thin lid.\"}"
